      <article id="seismic-building" class="outreach-entry">
        <h3><a href="/vulgarisation/modelisation-sismique-batiments/">Modélisation d'un bâtiment sous séisme</a></h3>
      </article>
    </section>
  </section>

  <section id="outreach-2025" class="outreach-year">
    <h2>2025</h2>
    <article id="playlist-chaud-devant" class="outreach-entry">
      <h3>Playlist de chercheur: Chaud devant</h3>
      <p><time datetime="2025-12-08">8 December 2025</time></p>
      <p><a href="https://exploreur.univ-toulouse.fr/climat-chaud-devant" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Listen to the podcast</a></p>
    </article>
    <article id="pint-of-science-2025" class="outreach-entry">
      <h3>Pint of Science 2025</h3>
      <p><time datetime="2025-05-21">21 May 2025</time></p>
      <p>Du Porto à Saint-Malo was held at The Roof, Halles de la Cartoucherie in Toulouse. The event invited two climatology PhD students to discuss climate change, its consequences, the attribution of extreme events and possible adaptation.</p>
      <p><a href="https://pintofscience.fr/event/du-porto-a-saint-malo/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Official event page</a></p>
      <details class="media-disclosure">
        <summary>View presentation (PDF)</summary>
        <p><a href="/documents/POS_pdf.pdf" download>Download presentation (PDF)</a></p>
        <object class="pdf-preview" data="/documents/POS_pdf.pdf#view=FitH" type="application/pdf" aria-label="Pint of Science 2025 presentation preview">
          <p>PDF preview unavailable. <a href="/documents/POS_pdf.pdf">Open the presentation PDF</a>.</p>
        </object>
      </details>
    </article>
    <article id="cycling-for-climate-2025" class="outreach-entry">
      <h3>Cycling for Climate 2025</h3>
      <p>2025; exact date not specified.</p>
      <p><a href="https://cyclopourleclimat.fr/inscription-cyclo-pour-le-climat-toulouse/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Event information</a> · <a href="/documents/SAVARY_8mn_C4C.pdf" download>Download presentation (PDF)</a></p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section id="outreach-undated" class="outreach-year">
